{"4307950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Quantum Era", "steam_appid": 4307950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▰▰  <i><strong>QUANTUM ERA</strong></i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A <strong>Third-person action roguelite</strong> built around <strong>escalation and consequences</strong>. </i><br><i>The first entry in the <strong>Nomad Chronicles</strong> franchise.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/5521252d5d87c1e08bef2d4ed5b40554.poster.avif?t=1782501753\" width=732 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/5521252d5d87c1e08bef2d4ed5b40554.webm?t=1782501753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/5521252d5d87c1e08bef2d4ed5b40554.mp4?t=1782501753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▰▰ <i><strong>THE NOMAD</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>G.I.O-NN.1</strong>, a reconnaissance robot long forgotten on an asteroid to mine its noble metals, he did not find Earth as he left it on its way back, dropped onto a hostile island controlled by autonomous robots protecting energy cores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>▸ MISSION OBJECTIVE:</strong> <strong>infiltrate enemy outposts, unlock powerups, and escape alive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing on the island is passive. Every action you take is monitored, evaluated, and answered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/63a32a0e56229cabdd84c813d5f7bab0.poster.avif?t=1782501753\" width=852 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/63a32a0e56229cabdd84c813d5f7bab0.webm?t=1782501753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/63a32a0e56229cabdd84c813d5f7bab0.mp4?t=1782501753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▰▰ <i><strong>A WORLD THAT REACTS TO YOU</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies respond to noise, combat, and visibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DETECTION:</strong> Being spotted raises local alert levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESCALATION:</strong> High attention triggers rapid enemy response.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TERMINATE:</strong> Fail to disengage, and <strong>heavy reinforcements</strong> are deployed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sometimes the smartest move isn’t to win the fight — it’s knowing <strong>when to run</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/428fcef7110306ccc333fa96735d5b33.poster.avif?t=1782501753\" width=852 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/428fcef7110306ccc333fa96735d5b33.webm?t=1782501753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/428fcef7110306ccc333fa96735d5b33.mp4?t=1782501753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▰▰ <i><strong>CHOOSE HOW YOU PLAY</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no single &quot;correct&quot; path. Adapt or expire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SILENT:</strong> Move undetected and disable threats before they react.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TACTICAL:</strong> Turn the environment into a lethal weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHAOTIC:</strong> Go loud and force your way through the consequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your arsenal across every run. You have <strong>3 chances</strong> before total system failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/dbf97e15f8ffaa15d1f6c2b0001f8f26.poster.avif?t=1782501753\" width=852 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/dbf97e15f8ffaa15d1f6c2b0001f8f26.webm?t=1782501753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307950/extras/dbf97e15f8ffaa15d1f6c2b0001f8f26.mp4?t=1782501753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▰▰ <i><strong>ROGUELITE PROGRESSION</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is new. Each death is a lesson.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADE:</strong> Unlock random weapons and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ADAPT:</strong> Counter increasingly aggressive enemy AI behavior.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE:</strong> Choose from mountain peaks to the sea depths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cl